  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 is in maintenance mode as of March 1st, 2026, with only critical bugs and security issues addressed until end of support on June 1st, 2026. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. AWS Wickr now provides a suite of admin APIs to allow you to programmatically manage secure communication for Wickr networks at scale. These APIs enable you to automate administrative workflows including user lifecycle management, network configuration, and security group administration.",
